Third-party assets and services:
- ZQL, a subset of the commercial font "ZouLDFXKAJ" (走路带风小可爱简 Regular),
  at assets/fonts/zql-c1.woff2, zql-c2.woff2 and zql-c3.woff2 (frequency-split
  subsets); loaded via jsDelivr by default. Distributed in
  this repository by the owner's decision; font listings mark commercial use as
  requiring authorization — verify before reuse.
- HarmonyOS Sans SC Medium: Copyright Huawei Device Co., Ltd., subject to the
  HarmonyOS Fonts License Agreement. Bundled at
  assets/fonts/harmonyos-sans-sc-medium.woff; loaded via jsDelivr when the
  HarmonyOS font source is selected.
- Fonts uploaded through the theme settings are provided by the site
  administrator and stored in usr/uploads/fonts; they are not part of this
  repository. The administrator is responsible for their licenses.
- Remix Icon: Remix Icon License 1.0 (https://remixicon.com/). Bundled at
  css/remixicon.min.css and css/remixicon.woff2 as a subset containing only
  the 20 icons used by the theme (generated with fonttools pyftsubset).
- highlight.js v11.11.1: BSD-3-Clause (https://highlightjs.org/).
- normalize.css v8.0.1: MIT License (https://github.com/necolas/normalize.css).
  Bundled at css/normalize.min.css with a local modification
  (h1 font-size 2em -> 1.5em).
